$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509622 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a3478e0-3b22-59cd-97c9-679bb68d2eab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨56,-25⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509561} {:answer/id #uuid "401cc2de-0483-5ca8-a35a-bbf90522fb3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨56,-5⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509573} {:answer/id #uuid "4ae548f9-f8f1-56e3-bce5-c9ccb476384d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨28,-5⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509576} {:answer/id #uuid "997868bd-9098-56f5-9e04-5b3105ab3470" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨28,-25⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509599} {:answer/id #uuid "a969d627-61c9-5798-ad06-5bda7d611dbc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨56, 25⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509604}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1a3478e0-3b22-59cd-97c9-679bb68d2eab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨56,-25⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509561} :answer-field/id #uuid "003e2339-7d87-55c0-b86a-6b608d316065" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509558}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f0dc7d92-0782-5ba2-857f-8c11c7d0d92f" :question/problem "Let $a = ⟨14, -10⟩$ and $b = ⟨-14,5⟩$. Find $a - 3b$." :question/worked-solution "To compute $a - 3b$, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\na - 3b &= ⟨14,-10⟩ - 3\\cdot ⟨-14,5⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨14,-10⟩ - ⟨-42,15⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨14 - (-42), -10 - 15⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨56,-25⟩\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509624 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6006dff6-96a2-5d0e-84a0-3b03e4ed0604" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨-8,-7⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509583} {:answer/id #uuid "bfc03e5e-4ea9-52d8-9a61-6b924